{"id":"sushchestvovanie","lemma":"существование","pos":"noun","rank":2436,"glosses":["existence, being","subsistence"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b2/Ru-%D1%81%D1%83%D1%89%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%83%D1%89%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"существования","plural":"существования"},"examples":[{"text":"Вы верите в существование бога?","en":"Do you believe in the existence of God?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to believe, to trust","l":"верить"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"God","l":"бог"}]},{"text":"Ты веришь в существование привидений?","en":"Do you believe in the existence of ghosts?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to believe, to trust","l":"верить"},{"g":"in"},null,null]},{"text":"Тепло и свет необходимы для нашего существования.","en":"Heat and light are necessary for our existence.","words":[{"g":"heat"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"light"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null]},{"text":"Я не верю в существование призраков.","en":"I don't believe that ghosts exist.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to believe, to trust","l":"верить"},{"g":"in"},null,null]},{"text":"Том верит в существование души.","en":"Tom believes in the existence of the soul.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to believe, to trust","l":"верить"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"shower","l":"душ"}]}]}